        "text": "Extract invoice details from the provided image/document.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON. Do not add markdown, explanations, or ```json.\n\nUse exactly this structure:\n\n{\n  \"seller\": {\n    \"company_name\": \"\",\n    \"address\": \"\",\n    \"gstin\": \"\",\n    \"email\": \"\",\n    \"phone\": \"\"\n  },\n  \"invoice\": {\n    \"invoice_number\": \"\",\n    \"invoice_date\": \"\",\n    \"due_date\": \"\"\n  },\n  \"customer\": {\n    \"name\": \"\",\n    \"address\": \"\",\n    \"gstin\": \"\"\n  },\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"item_name\": \"\",\n      \"quantity\": \"\",\n      \"rate\": \"\",\n      \"amount\": \"\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"totals\": {\n    \"subtotal\": \"\",\n    \"discount\": \"\",\n    \"cgst\": \"\",\n    \"sgst\": \"\",\n    \"igst\": \"\",\n    \"grand_total\": \"\",\n    \"amount_in_words\": \"\"\n  },\n  \"payment\": {\n    \"bank_name\": \"\",\n    \"account_name\": \"\",\n    \"account_number\": \"\",\n    \"ifsc\": \"\",\n    \"payment_terms\": \"\"\n  }\n}\n\nRules:\n- Extract only information that is actually visible in the document.\n- If a field is missing, use \"Not Found\".\n- Do not guess or invent information.\n- Keep amounts as they appear in the document.\n- Return valid JSON only.",
        "inputType": "binary",
